# social/ is the Instagram asset factory. It is its own package, it renders
# PNGs on a laptop, and the deployed site never imports a line of it.
#
# Left in, Vercel finds social/package.json and installs its devDependencies,
# which include Playwright. Playwright's postinstall downloads a browser, and
# the build fails. Nothing in here belongs in a deployment.
social/
research/
SOCIAL.md
